  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\" id=\"isPasted\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"cc2c3aeb-c76e-4eb7-a59d-ecb3e25a26ab\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"><h3 data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"137\">Our brand:</h3><p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"323\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><a href=\"https://alpine-footwear.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Alpine Footwear</strong></a></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span>is a comfort-first D2C footwear brand built for everyday life. We design slippers that feel like walking on clouds — simple, stylish, and made to be worn all day, anywhere.</p><hr data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"328\"><h3 data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"362\"><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"360\">&nbsp;Our Product:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"582\"><strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"99\" id=\"isPasted\">Alpine Footwear</strong> is built for everyday explorers. Our shoes combine durable materials, lightweight comfort, and modern design — making them perfect for both outdoor adventures and daily wear. Whether it’s city streets or nature trails, Alpine Footwear keeps you moving with style and confidence.</p><hr data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"587\"><h3 data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"628\">• <strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"626\">USP:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"843\"><li data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"657\"><p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"657\"><strong>$55+</strong> average order value</p></li><li><p data-start=\"375\" data-end=