r methods</p></li><li data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1010\"><p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1010\">$20 minimum payout threshold</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1015\"><h3 data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1047\">• <strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1045\">Other information:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1268\">We support our affiliates with fast communication, branded assets, and product samples for selected partners. If you're looking to promote a high-converting product with mass appeal, Alpine Footwear is a solid step forward.</p><p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1387\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://af.uppromote.com/cloud-bare-foot/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>JOIN ALPINE FOOTWEAR</strong></a></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><br></div></div></div></div>",
